{
  "key": 46175,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "You’re finally awake.\f",
        "Your friend Lyra was just here.\r",
        "She was playing hide-and-seek with\n",
        "her MARILL.\r",
        "Oh, I almost forgot! Our acquaintance,\n",
        "Professor Elm, was looking for you.\r",
        "He said he had a favor to ask of you.\r",
        "You know where the lab is, right?\n",
        "It’s right next door to us.\r",
        "By the way, do you have everything\n",
        "you need to go out?\f",
        "Here, use this Bag to carry things...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "You’re finally awake.\f",
        "Your friend Ethan was just here.\r",
        "He was playing hide-and-seek with\n",
        "his MARILL.\r",
        "Oh, I almost forgot! Our acquaintance,\n",
        "Professor Elm, was looking for you.\r",
        "He said he had a favor to ask of you.\r",
        "You know where the lab is, right?\n",
        "It’s right next door to us.\r",
        "By the way, do you have everything\n",
        "you need to go out?\f",
        "Here, use this Bag to carry things...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00002",
      "en_US": "This is your Trainer Card...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Here you can save a record of\n",
        "your progress...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00004",
      "en_US": "These are also rather helpful...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Just try touching the buttons, and\n",
        "you’ll know what to do in no time.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor Elm has been waiting for\n",
        "you, dear. Please, go and help him."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "That’s a cute Pokémon you have.\r",
        "Professor Elm must have given it\n",
        "to you?\r",
        "Oh, Professor Elm has a task for you,\n",
        "you say?\f",
        "What kind of task?\r",
        "...\r",
        "I see. That sounds a little difficult.\r",
        "But when someone makes that kind of\n",
        "request of you, it must be important!\r",
        "Oh, that’s right!\n",
        "I completely forgot!\r",
        "Your Pokégear came back from the\n",
        "repair shop!\r",
        "Here you go!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the Pokégear!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "The Pokémon Gear...\n",
        "or Pokégear, as it’s often called,\f",
        "is what every Trainer should have.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Guess what?\n",
        "You can use the Pokégear to make a\f",
        "phone call, too.\f",
        "Do you remember how? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Just power on the Pokégear and\n",
        "touch the telephone button, OK?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Select the POKéGEAR button on the\n",
        "Touch Screen. Then select the\f",
        "telephone button.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "The names of the people you can call\n",
        "are automatically registered.\r",
        "Just select one to give him or her\n",
        "a call.\r",
        "Wow, I can’t believe it’s so easy\n",
        "to make a phone call!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "What’s wrong?\r",
        "Did you forget how to get to\n",
        "Mr. Pokémon’s house?\r",
        "Go north on Route 30.\n",
        "Take care, dear."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "...\n",
        "So, you’re leaving on an adventure...\r",
        "OK! I’ll help, too.\n",
        "But what can I do for you?\r",
        "I know!\n",
        "Every time you receive prize money,\f",
        "I’ll save some of it for you.\r",
        "On a long journey, money’s important.\r",
        "Do you want me to save\n",
        "your money for you? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "I want to support you on your\n",
        "adventure, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\f",
        "OK! I’ll help, too.\f",
        "But what can I do for you?\r",
        "I know!\r",
        "Every time you receive prize money,\n",
        "I’ll save some of it for you.\r",
        "On a long journey, money’s important.\n",
        "Do you want me to save\f",
        "your money for you? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "OK, I’ll take care of your money.\r",
        "Be careful.\r",
        "Pokémon are your friends.\n",
        "When you work as a team,\f",
        "you can accomplish anything!\f",
        "Now, go on!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "OK, but be careful out there.\r",
        "Pokémon are your friends.\n",
        "When you work as a team,\f",
        "you can accomplish anything!\f",
        "Now, go on!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, stand firm!\n",
        "I’m always there for you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi! Welcome home!\n",
        "You’re doing fine, I see.\r",
        "I’ve kept your room tidy and clean.\n",
        "Or...\f",
        "Is this about your money? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00021",
      "en_US": "Just do what you can."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh!\n",
        "You have no money saved."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Your money’s safe here!\n",
        "Take care of yourself!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\n",
        "You should think hard how you spend it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00025",
      "en_US": "Do you want to save some money? {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh!\n",
        "You have no money left to save.\r",
        "Don’t waste your money on\n",
        "frivolous things, OK?\r",
        "I know you are sensible like me\n",
        "and that I can count on you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "I have saved so much.\n",
        "I can’t save any more."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "You have so much money already.\n",
        "I can’t let you have any more."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00029",
      "en_US": "WITHDRAW"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00030",
      "en_US": "DEPOSIT MONEY"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00031",
      "en_US": "CHANGE"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00032",
      "en_US": "EXIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00033",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Professor Elm told me that\f",
        "he has something to give you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00034",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor Elm told me that\n",
        "he has something to give you.\f",
        "Why don’t you visit his lab?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00035",
      "en_US": [
        "The TV is playing a movie!\r",
        "Two boys are in a cave searching\n",
        "for treasure!\r",
        "I better get going..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00036",
      "en_US": [
        "Cinnabar Volcano Burger!\n",
        "Mom’s specialty!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00037",
      "en_US": [
        "A squeaky-clean sink!\n",
        "Mom loves having it clean."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0545_T20R0201_00038",
      "en_US": [
        "What’s in the fridge...?\r",
        "Lots of drinking water and\n",
        "sweeeet lemonade!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
